{"id":"1804cec5e034","path":"/en/university/info/relint/team","lang":"en","title":"International Relations and Study Abroad Service","description":"The International Relations and Study Abroad Service is the administrative unit of the University in charge of international relations and academic mobility. Contacts Arianna Imberti Dosi - Head Via G. Buffi 13 6900 Lugano, Switzerland Office 331, Main Building tel.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","International Relations"],"image":null,"words":218,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/relint/team","en":"/en/university/info/relint/team"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"International Relations","path":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"International Relations and Study Abroad Service","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The International Relations and Study Abroad Service is the administrative unit of the University in charge of international relations and academic mobility.</p> <p><strong>Contacts</strong></p> <p>Arianna Imberti Dosi - Head<br> Via G. Buffi 13<br> 6900 Lugano, Switzerland<br> Office 331, Main Building<br> tel. +41 58 666 46 26<br> fax +41 58 666 46 47<br> e-mail <a href=\"mailto:ImbertiA@usi.ch\">ImbertiA@usi.ch</a></p> <p> <strong>Academy of Architecture</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Incoming and Outgoing exchange students</strong></li> </ul> <p>Stefano Bastianelli<br> Villa Argentina Largo Bernasconi 2<br> 6850 Mendrisio, Switzerland<br> Office V 0.05<br> Phone +41 58 666 58 03<br> fax +41 58 666 58 68<br> email <a href=\"mailto:relint.arc@usi.ch\">relint.arc@usi.ch</a><br> Office hours: Monday - Friday from 13.30 to 15.30.</p> <p><strong>Faculty of Biomedicine<br> Faculty of Communication, Culture and Society<br> Faculty of Economics<br> Faculty of Informatics</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>ESKAS grants reception service, Scholars at Risk (SAR) programme, InclUSIone project</strong><br> Mariaelena Biliato<br> Maurizia Ruinelli<br> Via G. Buffi 13<br> 6900 Lugano, Switzerland<br> Office 331, Main Building<br> tel. +41 58 666 46 26<br> fax +41 58 666 46 47<br> email <a href=\"mailto:relint@usi.ch\">relint@usi.ch</a> <br> Office hours: Monday, Wednesday and Thursday from 10.00 to 12.00 or by appointment </li> </ul> <ul> <li><strong>Incoming and Outgoing exchange students</strong><br> Laura Guerra<br> Ilaria Juon<br> Via G. Buffi 13<br> 6900 Lugano, Switzerland<br> Office 332, Main Building<br> tel. +41 58 666 46 26<br> fax +41 58 666 46 47<br> email <a href=\"mailto:relint@usi.ch\">relint@usi.ch</a><br> Office hours: Monday-Friday from 13.30 to 15.00 or by appointment</li> </ul> <p><strong>Team:</strong></p> <p><strong>​</strong></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Arianna Imberti Dosi","role":"Head of the International Relations and Study Abroad Service","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/relint-imberti-dosi-arianna-2.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"http://search.usi.ch/en/people/0cd87df7a1488b94e13bdadb51e54120/imberti-dosi-arianna\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Stefano Bastianelli","role":"Advisor (Mendrisio Campus)","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/relint-bastianelli-stefano.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"http://search.usi.ch/it/persone/bf5bb965ad7014d6c12d4913312f65fb/bastianelli-stefano\">Contacts</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Ilaria Juon","role":"Advisor (Lugano Campus)","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/relint-juon-ilaria.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/f5c91e0032f4d33ed17ea68c47523034/juon-ilaria\">Contact</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Maurizia Ruinelli","role":"Advisor (Lugano Campus)","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/relint-ruinelli-maurizia.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"http://search.usi.ch/en/people/884ea1e762b9e072b4199fc9af5fec1f/ruinelli-maurizia\">Contacts</a